  "description": "Deterministic text layout without AI: turns answers, summaries and reports into a headline, key-figure cards, paragraphs, lists, tables and callouts, using classical NLP and IR algorithms (TextRank/LexRank, TextTiling, MMR, argumentative zoning, text-table alignment). Guarantees no sentence is lost and no figure is invented. Renders to JSON, HTML (app or email) and plain text.",
